---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import cosmosData from '../data/cosmos.json';

const { siteConfig } = cosmosData;
---

<Layout title="About the Multiverse">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative py-20 px-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 flex items-center justify-center">
      <div class="w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-purple-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
      <div class="w-[300px] h-[300px] bg-amber-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
    </div>

    <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold text-purple-400 bg-purple-950/60 border border-purple-800/50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">
      Created by Wacky (Cisco / Francisco de Leon)
    </span>

    <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-tight">
      Welcome to the Multiverse Where <br />
      <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-400 via-pink-400 to-amber-300 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
        Music Comes First
      </span>
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-slate-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto font-light leading-relaxed">
      The Cosmos was not created in a traditional writer’s room. It was not mapped out on a whiteboard before the first word was penned. It began with a simple, resonant urge: <strong>to write music again</strong>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- Core Creative Sequence -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-slate-900/60 border-y border-slate-800/80">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-400 font-bold mb-4">The Creation Sequence</h2>
      <p class="text-2xl font-black text-white tracking-widest uppercase mb-12">
        Music &rarr; Stories &rarr; Lore &rarr; Cosmos
      </p>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 text-left">
        <div class="bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl">
          <div class="text-purple-400 font-black text-xl mb-2">01. MUSIC</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">The emotional thesis. Every character arc and civilizational shift starts as a melody.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl">
          <div class="text-pink-400 font-black text-xl mb-2">02. STORIES</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">The narrative expression. Chapters and scenes demonstrate the truth of the songs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl">
          <div class="text-amber-400 font-black text-xl mb-2">03. LORE</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">The archive. Systems, timelines, artifacts, and cosmic hierarchies documented.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl">
          <div class="text-emerald-400 font-black text-xl mb-2">04. COSMOS</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">The home. All levels and folds coexisting simultaneously across folded space.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Architecture: Levels & Folds -->
  <section class="py-20 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">🏛️ The Architecture: Levels & Folds</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-light">
        Forget line-by-line timelines or strict past-present-future rules. The Cosmos operates on the <strong>Levels and Folds Philosophy</strong>.
        Imagine an infinite structure where space has been folded, creating distinct realms that exist simultaneously. Every Level and Fold carries its own inhabitants, technological advancements, cultural structures, religions, and heroes—yet all coexist within the exact same greater reality.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Realm Cards -->
    <div class="space-y-8">
      <!-- Level 1 Fold 1 -->
      <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-purple-900/40 p-8 rounded-2xl relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-purple-600/10 rounded-full blur-2xl"></div>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-purple-400 bg-purple-950 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-purple-800/50">
          Level 1 &bull; Fold 1
        </span>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-4 mb-2">🌟 The Twins Saga & SOLARA</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          <strong>The Core Arc:</strong> Pandora Raven (The Light Twin raised in darkness) and Elara Dawn (The Dark Twin raised in light).
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          <strong>The Stakes:</strong> A 300,000-year cycle enforced by "The One" to prevent twin convergence. Spanning political wars, propaganda machines, time paradoxes, and tragic sacrifices, their journeys converge toward the rise of SOLARA.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Level 8 Fold 39 -->
      <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-sky-900/40 p-8 rounded-2xl relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-sky-600/10 rounded-full blur-2xl"></div>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-sky-400 bg-sky-950 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-sky-800/50">
          Level 8 &bull; Fold 39
        </span>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-4 mb-2">The Defective Detective</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          <strong>The Core Arc:</strong> Serah, a former police detective, runs the independent agency Serah Solves beyond a system constrained by corruption, political interference, and red tape.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          <strong>The Story Engine:</strong> Every investigation produces an answer, and every answer creates more questions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Level 12 Fold 15 -->
      <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-amber-900/40 p-8 rounded-2xl relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-amber-600/10 rounded-full blur-2xl"></div>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-amber-400 bg-amber-950 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-800/50">
          Level 12 &bull; Fold 15
        </span>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-4 mb-2">🎸 The Crimson Sparks, Maya, & That Guy</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          <strong>The Core Arc:</strong> A legendary rock-and-roll movement born in local dive bars that transformed into a global emotional fire.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          <strong>The Legacy:</strong> Following Suki, Soren, Sky, Sol, and Sienna through their journey from The First Spark to Wildfire and Embers—and seeing that spark passed forward to next-generation solo powerhouse Maya.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Level 15 Fold 15 -->
      <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-cyan-900/40 p-8 rounded-2xl relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-cyan-600/10 rounded-full blur-2xl"></div>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400 bg-cyan-950 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-cyan-800/50">
          Level 15 &bull; Fold 15
        </span>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-4 mb-2">🤖 Prima Et Timo</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          <strong>The Core Arc:</strong> An eons-spanning sci-fi saga exploring machine awakening, civilizational hand-offs, and deep found family.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          <strong>The Philosophy:</strong> "Same Core, Different House." Forms, species, and ages change across the 34-Age Great Cycle, but emotional truths remain identical.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How to Experience Section -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-slate-900/40 border-t border-slate-800/80">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-8 text-center">🎙️ How to Experience the Cosmos</h2>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl flex items-start space-x-4">
          <span class="text-3xl">🎵</span>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">The Albums</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed">Stream the soundtrack across Spotify, Apple Music, and YouTube. Each album represents a full narrative chapter.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl flex items-start space-x-4">
          <span class="text-3xl">📖</span>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">The Books & Fiction Lab</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed">Deep-dive into novelizations, side stories, character dossiers, and civilian perspectives adapting the emotional thesis of the songs.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl flex items-start space-x-4">
          <span class="text-3xl">🎙️</span>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Audio Overviews & Podcasts</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed">Listen to lore deep-dives, track-by-track comparisons, and in-universe radio broadcasts dissecting the mechanics of each fold.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-950 border border-purple-900/50 p-6 rounded-xl flex items-start space-x-4 bg-purple-950/20">
          <span class="text-3xl">🔑</span>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-purple-300">WackycsicO Records Patreon</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed">Join the inner circle to access exclusive bonus lore, full worldbuilding bibles, early manuscript previews, and behind-the-scenes creator content!</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 text-center">
        <a href={siteConfig.patreonUrl} target="_blank" class="inline-block bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-pink-600 hover:from-purple-500 hover:to-pink-500 text-white font-bold text-sm px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full shadow-lg transition hover:scale-105">
          Join the WackycsicO Records Patreon
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
